WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.490
I think I'll take those 
limbs of yours after all!

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:13.950
Zetsubi?

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.910
Why are you controlling Entei?

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.910
This little beauty I borrowed from Souya

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:23.790
gives Entei the illusion 
that I'm Reoko-sama.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.500
Is that even possible?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:31.070
If you don't want to get hurt, 
just be quiet and lose.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.340
You can't beat Entei, anyway.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.880
I don't know about that.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.480
We're a bit different now!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.610
Right, Azuma?

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:40.890
Yeah.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.520
Well, yes, it does seem that way.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:49.020
But I've got a lot riding on this, too.
I can't let you win!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.670
Prepare yourselves!

